# Limitations

This document describes the limitations of xLaDe. 
They are of two types --- 

1. Current limitations
2. Overall limitations

---

## Current Limitations

- Still in developmental stage, many directories not completely developed
- No automation support in experiments, CLI switching Lean, etc.
- No parallel experiment execution
- No compatibility warnings
- No experiment versioning/upgrading
- No AI integration

---

## Overall Limitations

- No backward compatibility
- No multi-prover support

---

## Not a Limitation

- Only Linux official support
- No GUI
- No support for python 3.13 or earlier

---
